---
layout: base.njk
title: Games
description: Browser games by Luke. Eddie vs Richie, Grok Snake, Cheeky Pete and Helpdesk Horde.
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<header class="page-head">
  <p class="kicker">Play</p>
  <h1>Games</h1>
  <p class="lede">Four games, played in the browser. Each one opens full screen, including on a phone.</p>
</header>
<ul class="game-grid">
  {%- for game in games %}
  <li>
    <a href="{{ game.href }}">
      <strong>{{ game.title }}</strong>
      <span>{{ game.text }}</span>
    </a>
  </li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ul>
